    During 2024 Ms. Jana Schwan became our Chief Executive Officer after having served as Chief Operating Officer since 2020, Vice President
    of Operations and a number of other roles of increasing responsibility during her 20 years with the Company. Mr. Yubao Li has been
    Chairman of the Board of Directors since 2020.</span></td></tr>

