    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Financing</i>.
    We entered into a credit facility during September 2021 that was extended during 2025 expiring April 2028. We have been in compliance
    with this credit facility since inception. </span></td></tr>

