    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><i>Develop
    New Channels of Distribution and New Sales Relationships</i>. We seek to organically develop new channels of distribution and new
    sales relationships, both for existing and new products. Over the past several years, we have developed new distributors and customers
    for our products in the United States and in Europe, Mexico, Latin America and Australia. We also look to leverage resources within
