equipment and related manufacturing assets pursuant to an Asset Purchase Agreement. The consideration consisted of <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions_c20240630__20240630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--AssetPurchaseAgreementMember_zS3J6d2gE5Fj" title="Transferred shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions" contextRef="From2024-06-302024-06-30_custom_AssetPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact000703" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares of
