and $<span id="xdx_906_eus-gaap--OtherAccountsPayableAndAccruedLiabilities_iI_c20241231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__custom--IcyMelonLLCMember_zcVeZEBaD0n9" title="Rent expense"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:OtherAccountsPayableAndAccruedLiabilities" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_custom_IcyMelonLLCMember" id="Fact001096" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">182,000</ix:nonFraction></span>, respectively, and are included in accrued expenses in the consolidated balance sheets. Rent expense for Barrington Facility
