The Selling Parties are affiliated with certain stockholders of the Company. The assets were acquired in exchange for <span id="xdx_90D_eus-gaap--StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions_c20240630__20240630__us-gaap--TypeOfArrangementAxis__custom--AssetPurchaseAgreementMember_zxKJPwXwCfh6" title="Transferred shares of common stock"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesAcquisitions" contextRef="From2024-06-302024-06-30_custom_AssetPurchaseAgreementMember" id="Fact001116" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="INF" unitRef="Shares">500,000</ix:nonFraction></span> shares
